  "ruleText": "Saf-C 1401.38 “Ride file jacket” means a file concerning an individual carnival or amusement ride which contains the information specified in Saf-C 1404.03.\n\nSource. #7618 eff 12-28-01; ss by #8342, eff 4-28-05, EXPIRED: 1-2-14\n\nNew. #10507, eff 1-21-14, EXPIRED: 1-21-24; renumbered by #11151, eff 8-11-16 (from Saf-C 1401.261); renumbered by #13535, INTERIM (formerly Saf-C 1401.281)\n\nNew. #14011, INTERIM, eff 6-27-24; ss by #14139, eff 11-28-24, EXPIRES: 11-28-34 (formerly Saf-C 1401.34) (see Revision Note #3 at chapter heading for Saf-C 1400)",
